<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Like That</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">loveshy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Like That</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2Gj8mzAEEi89PyjmBzy3pm</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.860" end="00:16.020">Hey I like your face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.020" end="00:21.660">You've got a wicked little smile like the devil's trying to give you away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.660" end="00:23.160">And I could pray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.960" end="00:25.080">For a sign but my minds telling pretty little lies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.080" end="00:27.480">Tell me baby am I preaching to the sinner?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.480" end="00:30.570">God you're such a killer oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.570" end="00:32.790">It's like any minute i'll be wrapped around your finger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.790" end="00:34.290">Baby pull the trigger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.840" end="00:36.060">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.060" end="00:37.560">I need it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.440" end="00:38.940">So treat me like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.790" end="00:40.290">You know i'll come back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.200" end="00:41.700">You scratch and I bite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.610" end="00:43.110">We kiss then we fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.110" end="00:44.640">I like it like that that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.640" end="00:46.140">That that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.090" end="00:51.300">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.300" end="00:52.800">That that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.660" end="00:59.660">Because you taste so bitter ah ah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.790" end="01:02.610">She's like a drug I can't quit her it's it's</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.610" end="01:04.260">It's like i'm falling though the floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.260" end="01:05.760">Yeah down the rabbit hole</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.730" end="01:08.970">I cannot deny it you know you leave me wanting more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.970" end="01:11.370">Tell me baby am I preaching to the sinner?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.370" end="01:14.520">God you're such a killer oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.520" end="01:16.380">It's like any minute i'll be wrapped around your finger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.380" end="01:17.880">Baby pull the trigger</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.700" end="01:19.980">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.980" end="01:21.480">I need it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.330" end="01:22.830">So treat me like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.710" end="01:24.210">You know i'll come back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.120" end="01:25.620">You scratch and I bite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.500" end="01:27.030">We kiss then we fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.030" end="01:28.530">I like it like that that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.290" end="01:29.790">That that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.650" end="01:35.820">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.820" end="01:37.320">That that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.180" end="01:41.160">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.160" end="01:49.160">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.740" end="02:00.740">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.900" end="02:05.400">I need it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.190" end="02:06.690">So treat me like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.600" end="02:08.100">You know i'll come back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.010" end="02:09.510">You scratch and I bite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.390" end="02:10.920">We kiss then we fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.920" end="02:12.420">I like it like that that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.180" end="02:13.680">That that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.540" end="02:20.040">Coz I like it like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.040" end="02:21.540">That that that that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.400" end="02:24.400">Coz I like it like that</p></div></body></tt>